Runtime third-party components
------------------------------

Satoshi (Fontshare)
  Referenced from the Fontshare CDN by frontend/index.html. Font files are not
  included in this export. License terms remain unverified; review before use
  or redistribution. Product CSS retains system-font fallbacks.

TradingView Lightweight Charts (lightweight-charts)
  Loaded at runtime from a public CDN by frontend/src/ProductApp.tsx.
  Copyright (c) TradingView, Inc. Licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
  TradingView's attribution requirements apply to any deployment that renders
  these charts. Upstream: https://github.com/tradingview/lightweight-charts

TradingAgents (optional deep-analysis dependency)
  Installed from a git URL pinned in requirements.txt
  (TauricResearch/TradingAgents @ v0.3.0). It carries its own license and
  pulls further transitive dependencies; review them before redistribution.

Python and JavaScript dependencies
----------------------------------

Full dependency sets are declared in requirements.txt, requirements-otel.txt,
pyproject.toml and frontend/package.json. Their license terms were NOT verified
during this export: the export ran with networking disabled, so no package
metadata could be fetched. A dependency-license review is required before this
repository is made public.
